libfsfat
------------------------------------------
libfsfat is a library to access the File Allocation Table (FAT) file system
format.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libbfio1-20260623-1bl1
  libcdata1-20260703-1bl1
  libcerror1-20260703-1bl1
  libclocale1-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify1-20260703-1bl1
  libcthreads1-20260703-1bl1
  libfcache1-20260520-1bl1
  libfdata1-20260521-1bl1
  libfdatetime1-20260521-1bl1
  libfsfat-devel-20260826-1bl1
  libfsfat1-20260826-1bl1
  libhmac1-20260522-1bl1
  libuna1-20260602-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1
  python312-3.12.12-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gettext-devel-0.22.5-1
  libbfio-devel-20260623-1bl1
  libcdata-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcerror-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcfile-devel-20260704-1bl1
  libclocale-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcpath-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcsplit-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcthreads-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libfcache-devel-20260520-1bl1
  libfdata-devel-20260521-1bl1
  libfdatetime-devel-20260521-1bl1
  libfguid-devel-20260521-1bl1
  libhmac-devel-20260522-1bl1
