  python3-3.12.12-1
  python3-devel-3.12.12-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libfsfat

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libfsfat/archive/refs/tags/20260826.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libfsfat-20260826-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libfsfat-20260826-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libfsfat-20260826-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfsfat-20260826-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfsfat1-20260826-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfsfat-devel-20260826-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libfsfat-20260826-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libfsfat)
  /usr/bin/fsfatinfo.exe
  /usr/bin/fsfatmount.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libfsfat.README
  /usr/share/doc/libfsfat/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libfsfat/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libfsfat/COPYING.LESSER
  /usr/share/doc/libfsfat/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libfsfat/File Allocation Table (FAT) format.asciidoc
  /usr/share/doc/libfsfat/README
  /usr/share/man/man1/fsfatinfo.1.gz
  /usr/share/man/man1/fsfatmount.1.gz

(libfsfat1)
  /usr/bin/cygfsfat-1.dll

(libfsfat-devel)
  /usr/include/libfsfat.h
  /usr/include/libfsfat/codepage.h
  /usr/include/libfsfat/definitions.h
  /usr/include/libfsfat/error.h
  /usr/include/libfsfat/extern.h
  /usr/include/libfsfat/features.h
  /usr/include/libfsfat/types.h
  /usr/lib/libfsfat.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libfsfat.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/libfsfat.3.gz

(python312-libfsfat)
  /usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pyfsfat.cpython-312-x86_64-cygwin.dll

